Nigel,

Make sure that the CPU card is part number 54-24490-01 and you're OK
for upgrading to a pair of Pentium 166s or a Pentium 200s.  You need
to change jumpers on the processor card, and that's all.

But forget the MMX processors.  The Celebris XL was not designed for
the dual-voltage MMX.

