along with TCP/IP on Win  95. What I do know is, if you use just TCP/IP with VMS 
printing you'll have to do the trick where you create a local port called lptx.dos
(where x is 1,2,3) and then capture it to the network path to the printer. 

Give me specifics and hopefully I can give you a more focused answer.



