UNIX was all it ran, as I recall, and some people REALLY didn't like that.
("What use is a computer that doesn't run VMS?")  At least, that's all that
was mentioned in the documentation I've seen.  Some of that documentation
may still be available from the Compaq research labs.  The other operating
