That site works OK with Netscape 4.05 on a MAC. But the www.digital.com home
page used to 
crash my mac. Don't know what they had in there. WWW.ADOBE.COM has some pages
with pop-up-selection menus (you know, surveys about job type, company type)
which freezes netscape without
crashing the mac).

I think that you cannot judge a platform's stability based on Netscape alone.
But the ability of the operating system to survive a netscape crash and
ability to restart netscape after a netscape crash without having any memory
of its previous failure is sign of a good operating system. If, when you
restart netscape, it crashes again, it measn that the operating system didn't
do a good job at cleaning up the process aftyer the "abend" (to use ibm terminology).



