> backward compatibility of VMS over the versions is an important feature.
> 
> The only example I can recall of VMS changing in an incompatible fashion
> (for non-privileged commands) was between V2.3 and V3.0 when DEC wisely
> decided that the default for the Backup command should be /NOREWIND to
> protect users from wiping out their own tape.
