You don't indicate which OS you are using.  I'll assume OpenVMS.  Then
again what version?  Older versions of OpenVMS are pickier about using
SCSI disks that are not fully SCSI compliant, newer versions are less picky.
You should try to be on at least 6.2 to resolve this problem.

Also, the hardware you are using limits the boot disk to be 1GB or less.



