>David J. Dachtera wrote in message <3587498C.3931@earthlink.net>...
>>Strictly my opinion, but I think the REAL killer was DEC's outright
>>refusal to put VMS on Intel/x86
>
>Well said!!!  Just imagine what the PC computing world would've been
like if
>PC/VMS was introduced back in the MS-DOS days.  A powerful, stable OS
that
>isn't as cryptic as UNIX. Billy G. would probably be a bit less rich
now
