Short Instruction word (5 bit), wide bus (32 bit), stack machines are
currently capable of 500MIPs peak with 10nS memory.  Up to 6
instructions per clock tick. 4 - 32K X 8 10nS SRAMs are going for less
than $24 total (1 ea price of $6). What kind of speed would that be in
your system?

Simon
