been doing off-site backups for years using TL820 and TL812 tape 
jukeboxes and the NSR software.  We now need to go beyond this minimal 
capability and have a hot site up and running.  Does anyone know of a 
method or S/W package to replicate file systems between two servers?  I 
am not looking for a simple minded dump and restore scheme, but rather 
something that operates along the lines of Sybase Replication with 
automatic update of files on two different servers.  BTW, both the 
servers will be DECsafe clusters running DU 4.0d and they will be 2000+ 
