ULTRIX uses the UFS, UNIX (ULTRIX) FILE SYSTEM. It can also speak NFS,
NETWORK FILE SYSTEM

OpenVMS speaks FILES11 ODS2 (ON DISK STRUCTURE LEVEL 2), NTFS, and through
Exchange can do RT-11 and some others.

