up roles, assign applications and users to the roles. So when you login it can
either replace your desktop with a set of applications your role is supposed to
have and automatically log you into this application when you select it. It
also manages password aging and synchronization of it across
applications/network resources/platforms. It also complies with the European
SESAME standards and it can work with all kinds of secure input devices (smart
card etc... if necessary).
It is used by major European Banks, Telecoms, UK Port Authority and some very
big US data processors.
