one and it is not recognized by the SRM console?

Set the ID switch on the floppy to 1 and power on the system, do a show
device at the SRM prompt. Do you see DVA0?, change the floppy ID to 0 and
do the power on and show device again. Still no DVA0?, then you have a bad
floppy cable or floppy controller.

