Greeting,
Regarding connecting the tx/rx and not using a star, I did, in another
life, connect tx/rx and tried to make it work in the fashion as
descripted above, but it did not work. I actually spent many days
trying. The non-use of a star in a CI enviroment is not supported and
will not work. The time I tried to make it work was early 1983 and these
new "magic" boxes had no names on them nor were there any install
manuals with them. The hand written instructions were not very clear,
and I didn't know something was missing. Needless to say, this was one
of the very first installs of a CI in the field.

I still work today with the CI technology and would not recommend trying
to make it "work".

Regards,
Tim



